---
// My Story tab — personal narrative
---

<div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8">
  <h2 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-lg text-[var(--color-accent)]">My Story</h2>

  <!-- Intro -->
  <div class="info-card p-5">
    <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
      Every good story needs a few plot twists. Mine took me through
      <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Dubai</strong>,
      <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Lebanon</strong>,
      <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Ireland</strong>,
      <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Serbia</strong>, and now
      <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Greece</strong> - through collapses, close calls, and
      more restarts than I can count. This is that journey, and the next chapter opens right here in
      Thessaloniki.
    </p>
  </div>

  <!-- Roadmap: The Journey -->
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <h3 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">
      The Journey
    </h3>

    <!-- Step 1: Dubai -->
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">Step 1 - Dubai, UAE</p>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/istyle-store.jpg"
             alt="iStyle Apple Premium Reseller storefront"
             class="w-full h-auto"
             loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        Every adventure needs an origin story. Mine starts in
        <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Dubai, UAE</strong>, where I spent three years
        working at <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">iStyle</strong>, an Apple Premium
        Reseller - getting hands-on with tech, dealing with customers day in day out, and learning the
        ropes of an industry I'd stay close to for years to come.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 2: Lebanon (brief stop) -->
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">Step 2 - Beirut, Lebanon</p>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Beirut_skyline,_Beirut,_Lebanon.jpg?width=1200"
             alt="Beirut skyline, Lebanon"
             class="w-full h-auto"
             loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        After Dubai I moved to <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">iStyle Lebanon</strong>,
        giving Lebanon a shot - it failed miserably, and that's when the next leg of the adventure kicked
        off: <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Ireland</strong>.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 3: Ireland -->
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">Step 3 - Cork, Ireland</p>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/apple-cork-ireland.jpg"
             alt="Apple office floor in Cork, Ireland"
             class="w-full h-auto"
             loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        From there I set off for <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Apple</strong> in
        <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Cork, Ireland</strong> - the dream on paper, a
        brutal test in practice. Then <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">COVID-19</strong> hit,
        and with family back home in Lebanon, I made the call to leave and come home worn out but not done.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 4: Lebanon again (hardship) -->
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">Step 4 - Beirut, Lebanon (Again)</p>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Port_of_Beirut_explosion_aftermath_4_August_2020.jpg?width=1200"
             alt="Aftermath of the Beirut port explosion, August 2020"
             class="w-full h-auto"
             loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        What came next read like a survival arc: an <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">economic
        collapse</strong> that wiped out over <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">90% of the
        currency's value</strong>, salaries turned to dust overnight, and <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">war</strong> -
        more than once. On <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">August 4, 2020</strong>, I was on
        the phone with my father when the Beirut port explosion tore through the city - I heard it live.
        Years later, war found us again, closer and louder each time. Blackouts, food scarcity, a country in
        freefall - I lived through all of it and kept moving.
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-3">
        <a href="https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wlk_NLJO3lM" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-lg overflow-hidden border border-[var(--color-accent-dim)] hover:border-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors">
          <img src="https://img.youtube.com/vi/wlk_NLJO3lM/hqdefault.jpg" alt="Life in Lebanon video thumbnail"
               class="w-24 h-14 object-cover" loading="lazy" />
          <span class="text-xs font-medium text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] pr-3">Watch: Life in Lebanon</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 5: Serbia -->
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">Step 5 - Serbia</p>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img src="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Petrovaradin_Fortress,_Novi_Sad,_Serbia_14.09.2016.jpg?width=1200"
             alt="Petrovaradin Fortress overlooking Novi Sad, Serbia"
             class="w-full h-auto"
             loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        Then the <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Linux community</strong> stepped in, and
        their generosity became the bridge that got me out and into
        <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Serbia</strong>, buying me the time and stability
        to plan the next leg.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 6: Thessaloniki -->
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">Step 6 - Thessaloniki, Greece</p>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/thessaloniki-black-pearl.jpg"
             alt="The Black Pearl pirate ship at the Thessaloniki harbor"
             class="w-full h-auto"
             loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        The search finally paid off: a job offer landed me in
        <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Thessaloniki, Greece</strong>, and I got my own
        rented apartment here - first real foothold in ages. New city, new country, new page, and for the
        first time in years the road ahead actually looks like it's going somewhere good.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- Step 7: Teleperformance -->
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">Step 7 - Teleperformance</p>
      <div class="rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
        <img src="/teleperformance-greece.jpg"
             alt="Teleperformance Greece office"
             class="w-full h-auto"
             loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        The job itself: <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Teleperformance</strong>, one of
        the world's largest customer experience and BPO companies, with a site right here in Thessaloniki.
        It's not the endgame - it's a foot in the door while I scout for something better paid - but it's
        steady work in a new place, and training kicks off soon. One level at a time.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- What's Next -->
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <h3 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">
      The Next Leg
    </h3>
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        Here's the plan: get settled, build real stability, and keep scouting for a better opportunity
        here in <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">Greece</strong>. And through it all,
        <a href="https://xerolinux.xyz" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="text-[var(--color-accent)] hover:text-[var(--color-accent-light)] transition-colors hover:underline">XeroLinux</a>
        keeps moving - being in a steadier place means more energy to throw at it, not less.
      </p>
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed italic">
        Do or do not. There is no try.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Support -->
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <h3 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">
      Help Me Build On This
    </h3>
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        If you want to help fuel the next leg of this journey, joining a
        <strong class="text-[var(--color-text-primary)]">monthly tier on Ko-fi</strong> goes a long way.
        This isn't about survival anymore - it's about building something solid, and every bit of support
        pushes the story forward.
      </p>
      <div class="flex justify-center pt-2">
        <a href="https://ko-fi.com/XeroLinux" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"
           class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium text-white bg-[var(--color-accent-dark)] hover:bg-[var(--color-accent)] transition-colors rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-[var(--color-accent-dim)]">
          <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M17 8h1a4 4 0 0 1 0 8h-1"/><path d="M3 8h14v9a4 4 0 0 1-4 4H7a4 4 0 0 1-4-4Z"/><line x1="6" y1="2" x2="6" y2="4"/><line x1="10" y1="2" x2="10" y2="4"/><line x1="14" y1="2" x2="14" y2="4"/></svg>
          Support on Ko-fi
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Thank You -->
  <div class="space-y-3">
    <h3 class="font-[family-name:var(--font-heading)] text-sm text-[var(--color-accent)] uppercase tracking-widest">
      Thank You!
    </h3>
    <div class="info-card p-5 space-y-4">
      <p class="text-sm text-[var(--color-text-secondary)] leading-relaxed">
        To everyone who's helped along the way, whether with money, a share, or just a kind word - thank
        you. This road's been long, and none of it would've been possible without people showing up for
        me. Here's to the next chapter of the adventure.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

</div>
